    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The property is located within an idyllic, tree lined estate of only 35 detached luxury homes in the heart of Kildangan village with all local amenities & services on your doorstep. The house overlooks a large green area to the front and the back garden is south facing. The accommodation extends to a generous 1,550 square feet with bright, spacious rooms and two large bathrooms. There are large front & back gardens with a spacious steel garage and two secure side entrances. \r\n\r\nThe house benefits from a host of fantastic features including: modern heating system with air to water heat pump, solid fuel open fire, immaculate condition throughout, extremely warm house, beautiful porcelain tiled floors, double glazed windows, open plan kitchen / dining room, mature front & back gardens, coving, recessed LED lighting, large walk in wardrobe, large south facing back garden with excellent potential to extend, large front driveway with ample off street parking, three spacious double bedrooms and two bathrooms. \r\n\r\nExcellent location in a popular, small estate in the heart of Kildangan Village with all local amenities & services on your doorstep including: shop, pub, primary school, preschool, petrol station, pub, take away, church, GAA club & community hall. The house is only 5 minutes from Monasterevin & 10 minutes from Kildare Town which also has a huge range of amenities including: Supermarkets (Tesco, Lidl, Aldi, SuperValu), shops, banks, restaurants, pubs, cafes etc. \r\n\r\nThere are a host of excellent creches, primary & secondary schools to choose from within a short drive of the house: Monasterevin (5 Minutes), Kildare Town (10 Minutes), Newbridge (15 Minutes), Nurney (5 Minutes), Rathangan (20 Minutes), Athy (15 Minutes) & Kilcullen (20 Minutes). The nearby Kildangan Stud (owned by Godolphin) extends to over 1,500 acres and is a world-renowned stud farm & breeding operation with state of the art facilities. \r\n\r\nThe house is located only five minutes from the M7 Motorway (Exit 14) and 10 minutes from Kildare Town (Exit 13), Kildare & Monasterevin also have excellent rail services to Dublin making commuting extremely convenient.\r\n\r\nKildare Village Shopping Outlet, The Curragh & the National Stud & Japanese Gardens are only 10 minutes away. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate its high quality."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Internal Features: \r\n\r\nPristine, turnkey condition throughout \r\nAir to water heat pump \r\nDouble glazed windows & doors \r\nBeautiful porcelain tiled floors \r\nMarble tiled splash back \r\nSpacious utility room\r\nC BER Rating \r\nBright neutral colours \r\nGenerous living space extending to 1,550 square feet \r\nCoving\r\nRecessed lighting \r\nHouse is in immaculate condition, decorated to the highest standard \r\nExtensive natural light, large windows on all sides of the house \r\nTwo superb bathrooms\r\nThree large double bedrooms with built in wardrobes / walk in wardrobe\r\n\r\n\r\nExternal Features: \r\n\r\nQuiet location in an exclusive development of only 35 detached luxury homes \r\nLarge south facing back garden\r\nLarge steel garage \r\nMature front & back gardens in excellent condition\r\nOverlooking a large green area\r\nLarge front driveway with ample off street parking \r\nSpacious patio area to rear\r\nTwo large secure side entrances \r\nExcellent potential to extend further \r\nOutside tap & lighting \r\nExcellent location in a quiet, highly sought after village \r\nShop, school, pub, take away, preschool, petrol station, church, GAA club all on your doorstep \r\nOnly 5 minutes from Monasterevin & M7 Motorway (Exit 14) \r\nOnly 10 minutes from Kildare Town & M7 Motorway (Exit 13)"
      },
